        "alt": "二通の封蝋招待状、九本の旗、弁当の観客、同時に立つ耳を描いた決闘祭の一枚絵"
      }
    ]
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "wolf-nine.epilogue.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "wolf-nine.epilogue.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "wolf-nine.epilogue.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "wolf-nine.epilogue.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "最終大会のあと、中庭で、前代未聞の祭りが開かれた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "wolf-nine.epilogue.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "wolf-nine.epilogue.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「第一回・休憩時間決闘祭」主催は、ヴォルフ・ナイン。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "wolf-nine.epilogue.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "wolf-nine.epilogue.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "参加資格は、休憩していること。九本の旗が、青空の下で揺れる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "wolf-nine.epilogue.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "wolf-nine.epilogue.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "競技は全八種目。昼寝の寝付き早さ、お茶の適温当て、ベンチ席取り。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "wolf-nine.epilogue.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "wolf-nine.epilogue.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "雑談のオチ対決、消印の押し方(受取所協賛)——全部、彼の愛する「休憩の全力」だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "wolf-nine.epilogue.node.line.002c",
      "lineId": "wolf-nine.epilogue.line.002c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "観客は弁当持参。計測係は、あの新人くん(規格外の判定に定評)。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "wolf-nine.epilogue.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "wolf-nine.epilogue.asset.still.001"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "wolf-nine.epilogue.node.direction.003",
      "command": {
        "type": "effect",
        "effectId": "pulse"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "wolf-nine.epilogue.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "wolf-nine.epilogue.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1vj9fme",
      "speakerName": "ヴォルフ・ナイン",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "八種目を制する者が、休憩王だ!"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "wolf-nine.epilogue.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "wolf-nine.epilogue.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1vj9fme",
      "speakerName": "ヴォルフ・ナイン",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "　ただし言っておく——この祭りに、敗者はいない!休憩したやつ、全員勝ちだ!"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "wolf-nine.epilogue.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "wolf-nine.epilogue.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "八年、勝敗に焦がれた人の大会規定は「全員勝ち」だった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "wolf-nine.epilogue.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "wolf-nine.epilogue.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "うちの闘技場の一年は、この一行のためにあった気がする。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "wolf-nine.epilogue.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "wolf-nine.epilogue.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "私は消印種目で優勝し(職権)、昼寝は耳が働きすぎて最下位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "wolf-nine.epilogue.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "wolf-nine.epilogue.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "夕方、総合成績はまたも同着多数。そして最後に、彼が第九種目を発表した。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "wolf-nine.epilogue.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "wolf-nine.epilogue.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1vj9fme",
      "speakerName": "ヴォルフ・ナイン",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "第九種目——「次の休憩へ、先に誘う」!　種目内容は言葉のとおりだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "wolf-nine.epilogue.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "wolf-nine.epilogue.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1vj9fme",
      "speakerName": "ヴォルフ・ナイン",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "次の休憩の約束を、先に取り付けた者の勝ち!　制限時間、日没まで!"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "wolf-nine.epilogue.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "wolf-nine.epilogue.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "中庭のあちこちで、「今度の休み、お茶でも」が始まった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "wolf-nine.epilogue.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "wolf-nine.epilogue.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "祭りの最終種目が、次の約束の取り合いになる設計。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "wolf-nine.epilogue.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "wolf-nine.epilogue.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "八年前の彼が見たら、ぬるいと言うだろうか。いや、たぶん、うらやましがる。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "wolf-nine.epilogue.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "wolf-nine.epilogue.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "日没間際、招待状が二通、同時に差し出された。一通は彼から私へ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "wolf-nine.epilogue.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "wolf-nine.epilogue.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "もう一通は、私が昼、受取所で書いて忍ばせたもの。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "wolf-nine.epilogue.node.line.008c",
      "lineId": "wolf-nine.epilogue.line.008c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「次の休憩、決闘祭の反省会をしませんか」同時。完全な、同着だった。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "wolf-nine.epilogue.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "wolf-nine.epilogue.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1vj9fme",
      "speakerName": "ヴォルフ・ナイン",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……っ、はは!　同着か!第九種目、勝者二名!"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "wolf-nine.epilogue.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "wolf-nine.epilogue.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1vj9fme",
      "speakerName": "ヴォルフ・ナイン",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "　……こういう決着も、あるんだな。八年前の俺に、教えてやりたい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "wolf-nine.epilogue.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "wolf-nine.epilogue.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "夕日の中で、狼の耳と兎の耳が、同時にぴんと立っていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "wolf-nine.epilogue.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "wolf-nine.epilogue.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "柿落としの出演届は、閉会宣言と一緒に貼り出された。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "wolf-nine.epilogue.node.line.010c",
      "lineId": "wolf-nine.epilogue.line.010c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "演目は「休憩時間決闘祭(全九種目)」、備考は「第九種目の結果は、非公表」だった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "wolf-nine.epilogue.node.line.010d",
      "lineId": "wolf-nine.epilogue.line.010d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……非公表で、いい。同着の招待状は、二通とも、机の一番いい場所にある。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "wolf-nine.epilogue.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
